// Body parts (medical model, see docs/SIM_MODEL.md). A wound lands on one part, picked by `hit`
// (relative chance of being struck). organs: organs of organs.ron housed in the part (a wound
// there also hurts them). limb: an extremity, first to freeze. effects: what the permanent
// disability of the part (0..1) takes off a trait key (same keys as organs.ron).
[
